        {"english":"She stopped crying when she saw her mother.","chinese":"看到妈妈后她不哭了。","soundmark":"/ʃiː stɒpt ˈkraɪɪŋ wen ʃiː sɔː hɜːr ˈmʌðər/","grammar":[{"label":"stop doing","text":"停止正在做的事"}]},
        {"english":"It is no use crying over spilt milk.","chinese":"覆水难收/后悔无益。","soundmark":"/ɪt ɪz nəʊ juːs ˈkraɪɪŋ ˈəʊvər spɪlt mɪlk/","grammar":[{"label":"固定句型","text":"It is no use doing sth."}]},
        {"english":"With so many people helping, we finished quickly.","chinese":"有这么多人帮忙，我们很快就完成了。","soundmark":"/wɪð səʊ ˈmeni ˈpiːpl ˈhelpɪŋ wiː ˈfɪnɪʃt ˈkwɪkli/","grammar":[{"label":"with复合结构","text":"with+n.+V-ing"}]},
        {"english":"Having finished his homework, he went out to play.","chinese":"做完作业后，他出去玩了。","soundmark":"/ˈhævɪŋ ˈfɪnɪʃt hɪz ˈhəʊmwɜːrk hiː went aʊt tuː pleɪ/","grammar":[{"label":"现在分词完成式","text":"Having done...+主句"}]},
